 t-shirt, and 1 case consisting of fifteen 7 oz. bags of RUFFLES(R) 3D's(R)
 brand Maximum Cheddar flavored snacks). ARV: $100. TWENTY (20) THIRD PRIZES:
 One MIM t-shirt and one MIM hat. ARV: $30. 100 FOURTH PRIZES: One
